This licence covers VEDA's own code only -- the contents of src/, installer/
and dashboard/, and the documentation in this repository.

It does NOT cover the eleven external prediction tools VEDA drives. Those are
separate programs by other authors, under their own licences. None of them is
included in this repository; the installer fetches the freely redistributable
ones from their authors and tells you how to obtain the rest yourself. In
particular, NetMHCpan, NetMHCIIpan, GibbsCluster, Seq2Logo and DeepLoc are
licensed by DTU Health Tech to a named individual and may not be
redistributed. See resources/tools/DTU_TOOLS.md.
